Group bank customers. Load `../data/customers.csv`, drop rows with `age == -1` (data-entry errors), and cluster on `age` and `credit_limit_eur` with a pipeline `make_pipeline(StandardScaler(), KMeans(n_clusters=3, random_state=42))`. Add the cluster as a column and print the mean age, mean credit limit and size of each cluster.
